Programs that the fleet runs, and that this program talks to
-------------------------------------------------------------

  * github.com/openai/orchard — FSL-1.1-ALv2
  * github.com/openai/tart    — FSL-1.1-ALv2

Orchard and Tart are separate programs. This program calls the Orchard REST
API with its own client and imports no Orchard package, because the FSL
permits every purpose except a competing use, and the AGPL-3.0 forbids a
further restriction on a distributed work. See
docs/adrs/0010-call-the-orchard-api-with-a-client-of-this-project.md.

The fleet operator installs Orchard and Tart, and the FSL of each version
converts to the Apache License 2.0 two years after its release.
